</main>
<footer>
  <div class="logo">AFK-BOT</div>
  <div>© 2026 AFK-BOT. All rights reserved.</div>
  <div class="disclaimer">
    AFK-BOT is an independent third-party tool and is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by any game publisher. Use at your own risk; automation may violate a game's Terms of Service.
  </div>
